--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1d3326426d8413f86dce414ff780b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChiefInspector_LabCall_P2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: Uh kid, the results came in.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59d60445be5554d98850a2453f40d9ed, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: What does it say there chief?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: It does have Julian's blood and...
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59d60445be5554d98850a2453f40d9ed, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: Yes?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: There's 2 fingerprints found on it. Head Chef Marco and Vivian Rose.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59d60445be5554d98850a2453f40d9ed, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: Vivian Rose? But she has no business in the kitchen or even touching the
      knife. She told me she can't cook.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: Exactly, one of them must have been involved. If you're sure it wasn't
      Marco, then it only puts Vivian Rose in the picture... no other fingerprints
      were found.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59d60445be5554d98850a2453f40d9ed, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: We caught the real culprit.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Chief Inspector Marcus
    text: I'd say don't jump to conclusions just yet... try confronting her first,
      see what she has to say. Maybe it is Marco after all. But you know better,
      kid. Good luck.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59d60445be5554d98850a2453f40d9ed, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: Thanks, chief.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
